// DEFECT (silent). `Holds when` on an act that also has `Except under` is ignored (007.2 says it is
// "not consulted"); nothing tells the author. Expected: a warning, or `go` lawful.
Fact p Identified by A
Bool free
Act open Actor p Holds when False
Act go Actor p
  Holds when free()
  Except under open
.
+free().
?!lawful go(A).          // WRONG: free() holds
